WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.391
Your materials are ready.

2
00:00:02.013 --> 00:00:04.058
Now it's time to make the search active.

3
00:00:04.784 --> 00:00:06.351
Job searching isn't only about

4
00:00:06.351 --> 00:00:08.655
finding postings and clicking Apply.

5
00:00:08.655 --> 00:00:10.710
It's also about conversations.

6
00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:12.401
Reach out to people you know.

7
00:00:12.401 --> 00:00:13.792
Ask questions.

8
00:00:13.792 --> 00:00:15.566
Let people know what you're looking for.

9
00:00:16.023 --> 00:00:18.046
Make targeted applications instead of

10
00:00:18.046 --> 00:00:20.163
sending the same application everywhere.

11
00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:22.892
The goal here isn't to bother people or

12
00:00:22.892 --> 00:00:24.833
ask them to find you a job.

13
00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:26.389
It's to create connections that can

14
00:00:26.389 --> 00:00:30.094
lead to information, introductions, and opportunities.
